  colour: {r: 0.96, g: 0.95, b: 0.88, a: 1}
  description: a sign-up sheet.
  logText: 'Pinned over it: A MESSAGE FROM THE EXECUTIVE OFFICE. WE VALUE DIRECT
    CONVERSATION WITH EVERY MEMBER OF OUR FAMILY. OUR DOOR IS OPEN. NO THIRD PARTY
    KNOWS YOUR WORK AS WE DO.


    Under it: STAFF OF THE MEMORIAL. YOU HAVE THE
    RIGHT TO ASK FOR A VOTE. SIGN HERE. Thirty-one names. Four are crossed out.


    By
    hand: Christmas was the last straw.

    A union won''t get you Christmas. Talk
    to HR, they listened about the parking.

    HR works for them.'
